+        metadata={
+            "help": "Keyword arguments for `transformers.AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained`, used when the `model` "
+            "argument of the `GRPOTrainer` is provided as a string. The `revision` value is also used when loading "
+            "processing classes."
